      "source_sha256": "d7787e2354e7e4cc5ee66a5840c6305653ba847ffa1aa51f61e74ce035500017",
      "target": "我们使用 `uv`：它比 pip 快 10-100x，还会自动管理虚拟环境。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-01:b0038",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Dev Environment",
        "## Build It",
