      "target": "```python\nimport sys\nprint(f\"Python {sys.version}\")\n\nimport numpy as np\nprint(f\"NumPy {np.__version__}\")\na = np.array([1, 2, 3])\nprint(f\"Vector: {a}, dot product with itself: {np.dot(a, a)}\")\n```\n"
