      "ordinal": 38,
      "source_sha256": "3d1bd7167ee71a82c124d9592bea18ebad82535a193573ddf3d2468f2b493a4b",
      "target": "**macOS / Apple Silicon（M1/M2/M3/M4）：** Mac 上没有 CUDA，这是预期情况，并非故障。**不要**传入 `--index-url .../cuXXX`（这些 wheel 安装包仅适用于 Linux/Windows，因此安装会失败）。安装常规版本即可，其中包含 Apple 的 MPS（Metal）GPU 后端：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-01:b0076",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Dev Environment",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 6: GPU Setup (If You Have One)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 38,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
